<title>USA: United Waste Systems Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>United Waste Systems Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	    Year Ended</p>
<p>		     December 31,		 December 31,</p>
<p>			 1996     1995(c)	  1996	1995(c)</p>
<p> Revenues   $93,858,281 $68,087,078 $335,743,175 $228,376,762</p>
<p>Operating expenses</p>
<p>		 57,190,300  41,617,158  206,786,205  140,813,834</p>
<p>Selling, general</p>
<p>and administrative</p>
<p> expenses    14,293,480   9,970,824   53,106,485   34,841,125</p>
<p>Operating income</p>
<p>		 22,374,501  16,499,096   75,850,485   52,721,803</p>
<p>Interest expense</p>
<p>		  3,895,295   3,130,790   14,949,746   10,061,290</p>
<p>Other (income)</p>
<p>expense, net</p>
<p>		  (879,451)   (237,192)	251,661    (948,830)</p>
