<p>income taxes</p>
<p>		 19,358,657  13,605,498   60,649,078   43,609,343</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>income taxes</p>
<p>		  8,142,312   5,170,068   25,619,566   16,779,259</p>
<p> Net income  11,216,345   8,435,430   35,029,512   26,830,084</p>
<p>Primary earnings</p>
<p> per share	0.28(a)	  0.22	0.88(b)	0.77(b)</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>earnings per share</p>
<p>		    0.27(a)	  0.22	0.87(b)	0.77(b)</p>
