<p>average equivalent</p>
<p> shares	40,139,099  37,545,095   39,943,715   34,693,501</p>
<p>(a) Primary and fully diluted earnings per share were $0.32 and $0.31, respectively, for the three-month period ended December 31, 1996 before deducting $0.04 per share in charges related to poolings-of-interests.</p>
<p>(b) Primary and fully diluted earnings per share were $1.07 and $1.05, respectively, for the year ended December 31, 1996 before deducting $0.19 and $0.18, respectively, per share in charges related to poolings-of-interests, loss on the sale of operations and debt refinancing expenses.  Primary and fully-diluted earnings per share were $0.79 and $0.78, respectively, for the year ended December 31, 1995 before deducting $0.02 and $0.01 per share, respectively, in charges related to a pooling-of-interests.</p>
<p>(c) Restated to reflect the pooling-of-interests with Salinas Disposal Service, Inc.</p>
